Additional permission (CC+)
---------------------------

In addition to the rights granted under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Utrecht University
grants every organisation, including commercial organisations, permission to use
the DAAF and this tool free of charge to assess its own applications and IT
landscape, and to share the results within the organisation and with its own
auditors and supervisory bodies. This includes consultants acting on behalf of
such an organisation.

This additional permission applies only if:

  - the DAAF is credited to its original author (Tim van Neerbos, Utrecht
    University) with a link to
    https://github.com/UtrechtUniversity/digital-autonomy-assessment-tool;
  - the DAAF is not presented as the method, model or product of anyone else,
    and no other names, logos or branding are added to it;
